      "self_resolved": [
        "measurement rows never linked to their own record; a linkified own-record column added (T073, FR-019)",
        "filter choice list built from the privacy-first manager would be empty for a published-but-private dataset; routed through the unfiltered manager (T040, D3)",
        "admin change was ordered before its own test; moved behind it into US-1 (T014 then T005, Article I)",
        "duplicate-slug refusal had no test at all; one added (T072, FR-050)",
        "demo search declaration was ordered before the test that fails without it; moved into US-3 (T030 behind T032, Article I)",
        "declaration validation asked whether a field supports a substring lookup, which every Django field does; replaced with a text-type test matching the one the registry already uses (T013, D12)",
        "eager loading was assigned to a queryset method that documents itself as not doing deep nesting, and to one also used for filter choice lists; moved to the view (T025, D13)",
        "menu suppression assigned to a method name rather than the attribute the library reads (T047)",
        "switcher block left unnamed; naming it avoids an override that would silently delete the search box (T069)",
        "research described the listing queryset as built from scratch, which would disable search and filtering (R3, R6)",
        "dead context keys and a settings comment naming a deleted template folded into the deletion story (T057, T058)",
        "an index task touching an inherited field would have pulled help text into four models' forms; exclusion recorded rather than done (data-model.md)",
        "six requirements and four success criteria covered in substance but uncited; traceability added"
      ]
    },
